{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262dYjK5KqsE1793484482.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：一股偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。同時，一道雲帶覆蓋該區。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：大致多雲，初時有一兩陣微雨。日間短暫時間有陽光，最高氣溫約28度。吹和緩偏東風，初時離岸風勢間中清勁。</p><p></p><p>展望：明日部分時間有陽光。隨後一兩日風勢較大。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:07.449175+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T22:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:00.993878+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:06.411143+00:00","content_hash":"bebc8fb2725e5cbc585f7bf90b05a9f6aeb10e4ca61f971257e5eeb216b607b4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}